# Discord Tennis League - Cursor Rules

## Stack
Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Airtable, Sonner toasts, React Hook Form + Zod

## File Structure
- `components/` - React components
- `components/ui/` - shadcn/ui components
- `types/index.ts` - All TypeScript interfaces
- `lib/` - Utilities (`cn()`, Airtable client)
- Use `@/` imports

## Project-Specific Patterns
- **Privacy**: Use `formatNameForPrivacy()` for player names (shows last initial only)
- **Dates**: Use `formatDate()` utility
- **Toasts**: Use Sonner
- **Styling**: Tailwind only, use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes
- **Tables**: Desktop tables + mobile card views for responsive design

## Key Rules
- Define types in `types/index.ts`, import with `import type { ... } from "@/types"`
- Use `"use client"` directive for client components
- No `any` types, no inline styles, no custom CSS
